WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.984 --> 00:00:03.805
Everyone trembled in fear.

2
00:00:03.845 --> 00:00:07.688
The captain of the Sleeping Dragon circled the room.

3
00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:13.852
He was breathing "Where is my good-luck bear charm?"

4
00:00:13.872 --> 00:00:15.653
He stopped in front of the boys.

5
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.422
"Sir, I swear, I don't know," Gunnar pleaded.

6
00:00:36.442 --> 00:00:42.864
"Silence! My father gave that bear charm to me when I killed my first bear.

7
00:00:43.965 --> 00:00:46.466
Its power has made me the best bear hunter!

8
00:00:47.306 --> 00:00:49.027
It's my most precious treasure."

9
00:00:50.108 --> 00:00:52.028
The captain poked Gunnar hard.

10
00:00:53.189 --> 00:00:57.431
Gunnar grabbed Vinnie and said in angry voice, "Vinnie!

11
00:00:57.851 --> 00:00:58.791
Did you take it?

12
00:00:59.251 --> 00:01:00.172
I trusted you!"

13
00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:04.583
"No, no, I didn't take it," cried Vinnie.

14
00:01:05.443 --> 00:01:10.047
Skull-Crusher looked around the room and roared, "Where is the girl?"

15
00:01:11.768 --> 00:01:16.351
At that moment, Mandy and Birgitta were returning from the neighbor's house.

16
00:01:17.532 --> 00:01:21.755
They were about to enter Birgitta's home through a door near the animals.

17
00:01:22.796 --> 00:01:25.498
The girls could hear an angry voice inside.

18
00:01:26.358 --> 00:01:28.180
Mandy stuck her head in the door.

19
00:01:30.016 --> 00:01:31.617
"It's Skull-Crusher!"

20
00:01:32.398 --> 00:01:33.759
she whispered urgently.

21
00:01:33.779 --> 00:01:36.582
"He looks very angry."

22
00:01:36.602 --> 00:01:38.303
"What should we do?"

23
00:01:39.084 --> 00:01:40.585
asked Birgitta anxiously.

24
00:01:40.605 --> 00:01:45.008
"The last time he was this mad, he smashed up our house."

25
00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.771
Mandy looked at the animals.

26
00:01:49.752 --> 00:01:52.334
She noticed a lit oil lamp by the door.

27
00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:54.336
She had an idea.

28
00:01:54.356 --> 00:02:01.017
"When I say so, let the animals loose," she instructed Birgitta.

29
00:02:02.998 --> 00:02:04.479
Mandy picked up the lamp.

30
00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.162
She placed the flame near one pig's tail.

31
00:02:08.182 --> 00:02:11.404
"Now!" she cried.

32
00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:18.068
Just as Birgitta opened the pen, the pig felt the heat and rushed forward.

33
00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:24.353
The other animals cried as well and ran through the house.

34
00:02:24.373 --> 00:02:27.555
"Vinnie!" Mandy cried.

35
00:02:27.575 --> 00:02:29.176
"Over here!"

36
00:02:30.764 --> 00:02:34.125
Vinnie tried to sneak away, but the captain saw him.

37
00:02:35.165 --> 00:02:37.606
"Stop! Where are you going?"

38
00:02:38.386 --> 00:02:39.606
shouted Skull-Crusher.

39
00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.907
A fat pig blocked the captain's way.

40
00:02:44.148 --> 00:02:46.468
Vinnie ran and made it to the back door.

41
00:02:46.488 --> 00:02:51.530
"Mandy, I have to ask you something," he gasped.

42
00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:55.211
Mandy grabbed his hand and started running.

43
00:02:55.231 --> 00:02:57.591
"Ask me later, Vinnie.

44
00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.792
Right now, we have to run!"

45
00:03:01.096 --> 00:03:04.418
They kept running until they reached an open field.

46
00:03:05.499 --> 00:03:07.100
It looked like a shipyard.

47
00:03:11.282 --> 00:03:13.123
is the captain so angry?"

48
00:03:15.185 --> 00:03:17.566
Mandy asked, taking a deep breath.

49
00:03:18.527 --> 00:03:21.588
"Somebody took his bear charm," said Vinnie.

50
00:03:21.608 --> 00:03:23.670
"He thinks we did it!"

51
00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:25.671
"His charm?

52
00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:27.332
You mean this?"

53
00:03:28.284 --> 00:03:31.805
Mandy took the little carved bear from her front pocket.

54
00:03:33.385 --> 00:03:34.706
"So you have it!"

55
00:03:35.466 --> 00:03:36.246
Vinnie shouted.

56
00:03:36.266 --> 00:03:38.807
"Old Dirk gave it to me!"

57
00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:40.427
Mandy cried.

58
00:03:40.447 --> 00:03:45.329
"Well, we have to give it back," said Vinnie.

59
00:03:45.349 --> 00:03:47.910
"And we have to get out of here."

60
00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:52.431
Vinnie pulled the photo out of his pocket and studied it.

61
00:03:53.211 --> 00:03:56.372
The sail in the photo was still glowing yellow.

62
00:03:57.056 --> 00:03:59.857
"It shows a ship with sails," he said.

63
00:03:59.877 --> 00:04:02.718
"But I didn't see any sails."

64
00:04:04.138 --> 00:04:05.799
Mandy pointed at the photo.

65
00:04:05.819 --> 00:04:09.600
"What are those glowing things on the ship's side?

66
00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.621
They look like big round plates."

67
00:04:12.641 --> 00:04:16.542
"I don't know," replied Vinnie.

68
00:04:16.562 --> 00:04:19.543
"But I think we should head back to the harbor."

69
00:04:19.563 --> 00:04:24.304
"And return Skull-Crusher's charm," said Mandy.
